msgid "把 ertangle-ade skill 安裝到 agent 的 skills 目錄"
msgstr "Install the ertangle-ade skill into an agent's skills directory"

#: src/cmd/helptext/help_strings.rs
msgid "把 session (與其子 Session 樹)匯出為 Markdown 協作報告"
msgstr "Export a session (and its sub-session tree) as a Markdown collaboration report"

#: src/cmd/helptext/help_strings.rs
msgid "把 session 的工作交接給另一個 agent (額度用完時)：沿用同一個工作目錄，附上交接簡報與 diff"
msgstr "Hand a session's work off to another agent (when quota runs out): reuses the same working directory and attaches a handoff brief and diff"

#: src/cmd/helptext/help_strings.rs
msgid "指定 events.jsonl 路徑 (預設為 ertangle 自己的 log)"
msgstr "Path to events.jsonl (defaults to ertangle's own log)"

